WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:18.150
One winter morning Kip woke up.

2
00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:20.515
The air was cold.

3
00:00:20.516 --> 00:00:23.546
The wind howled outside.

4
00:00:23.547 --> 00:00:26.568
Kip shivered. "Brr!"

5
00:00:26.569 --> 00:00:28.340
He hugged himself.

6
00:00:28.341 --> 00:00:31.874
"It's so cold!" said Kip.

7
00:00:31.875 --> 00:00:38.624
A few snowflakes flew into his hole.

8
00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:40.946
Kip's eyes lit up.

9
00:00:40.947 --> 00:00:43.928
"It's snowing!" he cried.

10
00:00:43.929 --> 00:00:47.147
"Bird and I can play in the snow!"

11
00:00:47.148 --> 00:00:49.419
Kip jumped out of bed.

12
00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:52.275
He ran to his closet.

13
00:00:52.276 --> 00:00:56.780
He found a scarf, a hat, and boots.

14
00:00:56.781 --> 00:00:59.642
Kip put on the snow gear.

15
00:00:59.643 --> 00:01:06.255
He stepped out of his hole.

16
00:01:06.256 --> 00:01:08.687
A gust of wind blew.

17
00:01:08.688 --> 00:01:10.805
And Kip fell.

18
00:01:10.806 --> 00:01:13.764
"Ahh!" cried Kip.

19
00:01:13.765 --> 00:01:17.638
Poomf! He landed in the deep snow.

20
00:01:17.639 --> 00:01:20.906
Wind and snow blew all around.

21
00:01:20.907 --> 00:01:23.561
Bird looked down from her nest.

22
00:01:23.562 --> 00:01:27.541
"Kip, are you okay?" she called.

23
00:01:27.542 --> 00:01:30.860
"I'm okay," said Kip.

24
00:01:30.861 --> 00:01:33.738
"I'm going to play in the snow."

25
00:01:33.739 --> 00:01:37.624
"You can't play outside now," said Bird.

26
00:01:37.625 --> 00:01:40.998
"There's a blizzard!"
